    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1542">

                <pb facs="1155" n="1039" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1039"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.5212/49.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Silliman
                        to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-21">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 21, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s May 20. Yesterday Madrid informed representative here as follows
                    respecting envoy to Villa: “Zapico does not carry with him appointment as
                    confidential agent.”</p>
                <p>Carranza government appears content with this and mission of representative here
                    will not be prejudiced.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Silliman.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
